          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoswa akumpunda Mwenye Yabini ni ayimwene ŵane ŵa ku mpoto",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Yabini jwa ku Hasoli piŵapikene mbili ja kupunda kwa Aisalaeli, ŵatumisye maloŵe kwa Mwenye Yobabu jwa ku Madoni, ku ayimwene ŵa ku Shimuloni ni Akishafu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ni kwa ayimwene ku cilambo ca kwitumbi kumpoto, m'Ciŵata ca Yolodani kum'mwela kwa Nyasa ja Galileya, mwiŵanda mwa matumbi, ni mungulugulu mwa nyasa ciŵandika ni Doli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwe ŵatumisye soni maloŵe kwa Akenani ku mbali syosope siŵili sya Yolodani, ku Aamoli, Ahiti, Apelesi, ni Ayebusi ku cilambo ca kwitumbi, yalumo mpaka kwa Ahifi ŵiŵatamaga mwiŵanda mwa Litumbi lya Helimoni mcilambo ca Misipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanjajo ŵayice ni asilikali ŵawo wosope, likuga lya ngondo ni acalume ŵajinji mpela muwukuŵela mcenga mungulugulu nyasa. Ŵakwete soni mahaci gejinji ni mageleta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵele ayimwene wosopeŵa ŵasongene pamo ni kupanganya cigono ku Lusulo lwa Melomu. Kweleko ŵapwatikenye ŵa ngondo kuti amenyane ni Aisalaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵatite kwa Yoswa, “Mkasimwajogopa jemanjajo. Malaŵi ndaŵi mpela jinojino tinjiŵa ndili nawuleje wosope ŵa jemanjaji ligongo lya Isalaeli. Panyuma pa ngondojo, timgalemasye mahaci gawo pakugakata mitasi jekulungwa ja ngongolo sya kunyuma kuti tigalepele kwenda ni kugajoca mageleta gawo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Yoswa ni acalume ŵakwe wosope ŵatandite jemanjajo mwakusisimucisya pa Lusulo lwa Melomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE ŵapundisye Aisalaeli pa jemanjajo; Aisalaeli ŵatandite ni kwatoposya jemanjajo mpaka kumpoto ku Misilefoti Mayimu ni Sidoni, nipo mpaka kungopoko lyuŵa kwa Ciŵata ca Misipa. Ngondo japitilisye mpaka pangali jumo jwa amagongo juŵasigele jwacijumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa ŵatesile jemanjajo yiŵamlamwile AMBUJE: jwalakwe ŵagatendesye mahaci gawo kuŵa gelemale ni ŵagajocile mageleta gawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko Yoswa ŵawujile panyuma, ŵasumwile msinda wa Hasoli ni kumwulaga mwenye jwakwe. (Pa jele ndaŵijo Hasoli lyaliji likulungwa lya ma ucimwene gosope genego). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanjajo ŵamwuleje jwalijose kweleko; pangali jumo juŵasigele cijumi, nipo msindawo ŵawujocice moto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa ŵasumwile misinda josopeji pamo ni ayimwene ŵakwe, ni kumwulagaga jwalijose, mpela muŵalamulile Mose,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jwakutumicila jwa AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo, Aisalaeli nginajoca uliwose wa misinda jijataŵidwe pakwela pa yagumuka yiyataŵidwe kala, kutyosyapo msinda wa Hasoli basi, uŵawujocile Yoswa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli ŵajigele katundu josope jwene ni yilangwa yakwe kutyocela ku jele misindaji ni kumsunga kuŵa jwawo. Nambo ŵawuleje mundu jwalijose; pangali jumo juŵasigele jwa cijumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE ŵaliji ali apelece malamusi gawo kwa jwakutumicila jwawo Mose, Mose ŵaliji ali agapelece kwa Yoswa, nipo Yoswa ŵagapikanile. Jwalakwe ŵatesile yosope yene yiŵamlamwile AMBUJE Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoswa akusumula cilambo ciŵamsalile AMBUJE",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa ŵasumwile cilambo cosope ca kwitumbi ni kwiŵanda kwakwe, mbali syosope siŵili kumpoto ni kum'mwela, upande wosope wa Gosheni ni cilambo cejumu ca kum'mwela ni Ciŵata ca Yolodani cakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cilamboco cajendelecele kum'mwela kutyocela ku Litumbi lya Halaki ciŵandika ni Edomu, mpaka ku Baala Gadi kumpoto, m'Ciŵata ca Lebanoni kum'mwela kwa Litumbi lya Helimoni. Yoswa ŵaliji pa ngondo ni ayimwene ŵa cele cilamboci kwa ndaŵi jelewu, nambo ŵakamwile wosopewo ni kwawulaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.17+JOS.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.17",
              "JOS.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Msinda umope uwatesile mtendele ni ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli ni wa Gibiyoni, kuŵatamaga ŵane ŵa Ahifi. Ŵane wosope ŵapundile ku ngondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE ŵatendesye kumula mitima kuti amenyane ni Aisalaeli, kuti jemanjajo ajonasice mnope nipo wosope awulajidwe pangali canasa. Amu ni mwele Mlungu muŵamlamulile Mose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Det 7:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa jele ndaŵiji, Yoswa ŵapite kukuwujonanga mtundu wa ŵandu ŵalewulewu ŵakolanjidwa Aanakimu ŵiŵatamaga ku cilambo ca kwitumbi ku Hebuloni, Dibili, Anabu, ni mcilambo cosope ca kwitumbi ca Yuda ni Isalaeli. Yoswa ŵamasile kwajonanga jemanjajo ni misinda jawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pangali jumo jwa ŵandu ŵa mtundu wa Anakimuwo juŵasigele mcilambo ca Isalaeli; ŵapanandipe, ŵasigele ku Gasa, Gati, ni ku Ashidodi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa ŵasumwile cilambo cosope, mpela muŵamlamulile AMBUJE, Mose. Yoswa ŵacipelece kwa Aisalaeli kuŵa cawocawope nipo ŵacigaŵenye m'maupande, upande umo ku lukosyo lululose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakumalicisya pakwe mwaliji mwana mtendele mcilambomo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
